{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdMAtMrbgPfb4aXCKBxSF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! This is very thorough. Now I understand the context. The Phase 3 task is to implement planner integration for artifact inheritance. Let me review what Phase 3 should complete:\n\nFrom the task description:\n> Phase 3 complete: \n> (1) Planner decision methods examine prior_worker.produced_artifacts\n> (2) SpawnRequests populated with inherited_artifacts based on planner logic\n> (3) Planner decisions include reasoning for artifact inheritance\n> (4) All tests pass\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Look at the planner code (app/services/orchestrator/planner.rb)\n2. Look at the PlannerDecisionJob (app/jobs/planner_decision_job.rb)\n3. Implement methods that examine prior_worker.produced_artifacts\n4. Update the code to populate inherited_artifacts in SpawnRequest\n5. Include reasoning for artifact inheritance\n6. Make sure all tests pass\n\nLet me start by reading the current planner code and the planner decision job.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6853,"cache_read_input_tokens":24800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6853},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b4af749-2a39-4012-a7f2-ddf24e6c5426","uuid":"74271e99-06b1-4c93-b1c2-d3f9ef8ec7e7","timestamp":"2026-07-24T16:08:04.323Z","request_id":"req_011CdMAtLeuyYa4AiUJTjdeg"}
